  },
  {
    question: 'How should I judge my first BCA internship or job offer?',
    answer:
      'Do not judge only by the label. Check whether the role builds real skill, matches your direction, gives future proof you can show later, and fits your current financial context. A first offer is useful when it becomes a step up, not just a random start.',
  },
