      After you run a path through <strong>The 4-Checkpoint Protocol</strong>, test it through <strong>The 3 Gates</strong>.
    </p>

    <div class="gates-block">
      <p class="gates-block__title">A path is stronger when it passes all three gates, not just the hype gate.</p>
      <div class="gates-row">
        {gateItems.map((gate) => (
