  <section id="next-step">
    <p class="eyebrow">Action plan</p>
    <h2>What to do next if you are serious about BCA career options</h2>
    <p>
      First, pick the top two routes that still look strongest after <strong>The 4-Checkpoint Protocol</strong> and <strong>The 3 Gates</strong>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Second, spend a short, focused stretch building one small proof asset for each route — some people need a couple of weeks, others need longer.
    </p>
    <p>
      Third, notice which work feels more natural and which one you can explain more clearly.
    </p>
    <p>
      Fourth, commit harder to one route for a real, focused stretch — however long that genuinely takes for you — instead of staying scattered.
